{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Science and Scientists Dinner", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Pronouncing Silent Letter Words", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Silent letters are letters that appear in a particular word but they are not pronounced when the word is said. The <span class=\"italic\">c</span> is sometimes silent in English when it follows  an <span class=\"underline\">s</span> in a word.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you pronounce these words, you pronounce the <span class=\"italic\">s</span>, but not the <span class=\"italic\">c</span>. <br/><br/>science<br/>   scientist<br/>  scene<br/>  scent<br/> ascend<br/>  crescent<br/>  descend<br/>  fascinate<br/>  fluorescent <br/> isosceles<br/>  luminescent<br/>  miscellaneous<br/>  scenario", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I see you took my advice and had the stairs ascend in the center to a crescent-shaped head table.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Is it possible to descend on either side as well?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The luminescence of the small fluorescent lights is delightful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Have you noticed how we mounted scenes from scientific discoveries on large isosceles triangles on the wall?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Pronunciation of Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Where do you put the stress in a phrasal verb?", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "If the phrasal verb is not separable, then you stress the verb.<br/><br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">go</span> over<br/> Let's <span class=\"strong\">go</span> over the menu.</span> (go over - is not finished without the object <span class=\"italic\">menu</span>.)<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I didn't <span class=\"strong\">hear</span> back.</span><br/><br/>  If the Phrasal verb is separable, then the stress is on the particle (preposition).<br/><br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">pull <span class=\"strong\">off</span></span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I knew you could pull this party <span class=\"strong\">off</span>!<span class=\"italic\">", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Would you like to <span class=\"strong\">go</span> over the menu again?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I've <span class=\"strong\">heard</span> back from everyone.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">As promised, we will clean <span class=\"strong\">up</span> quickly after dinner and clear <span class=\"strong\">away</span> the tables.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">That can happen right after we give <span class=\"strong\">out</span> the miscellaneous awards.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can we light <span class=\"strong\">up</span> the candles and bring <span class=\"strong\">in</span> the small orchestra then? </span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">We'll <span class=\"strong\">carry</span> on our evening with cocktails, nibbles and dancing!</span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to ascend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go up", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You ascend the steps in the center.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about an event.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to descend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go down", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can descend the stairs on either side of the stage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "luminescence", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a soft light", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The luminescence of the small lights is delightful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fluorescent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "producing a bright light, usually from tube-shaped bulbs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These lights are fluorescent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pull off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to manage to do something difficult", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I knew I could count on you to pull this dinner off!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to do without", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to manage without having", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's interesting, but we could do without it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to clear away", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remove things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After dinner we'll clear away the tables.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "miscellaneous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "various", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're going to give out the miscellaneous awards.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a good reason for planning a party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the things you will need for the party including the menu and decorations and gifts for the guests.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph describing the plan for the party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use at least two phrasal verbs and two <span class=\"italic\">SC</span> words. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph and add any other ideas you come up with.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I discuss the planning of a party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write out a plan.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use <span class=\"italic\">SC</span> words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Come along with me, Ms. Scenario. Do you like  what we have come up with for the Science and Scientists dinner?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: I see you took my advice and had the stairs ascend in the center to a crescent-shaped head table. Is it possible to descend on either side as well?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Yes, Ms. Scenario. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: The luminescence of the small fluorescent lights is delightful."}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "18000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Have you noticed how we mounted scenes from scientific discoveries on large isosceles triangles on the wall?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: Fascinating! I knew I could count on you to pull this dinner off! Is there a scent in the room as well?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Yes, a slight one. Does it meet with your approval?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: It's interesting, but we could do without it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Would you like to go over the menu again? The starters, the main course, and dessert?"}, {"image": "engenn8le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "41000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: I'm sure it's fine. I've heard back from everyone. It's a full house!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: As promised, we will clean up quickly after dinner and clear away the tables.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: That can happen right after we give out the miscellaneous awards.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Host</span>: Can we light up the candles and bring in the small orchestra then? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Scenario</span>: Yes. We'll carry on our evening with cocktails, nibbles and dancing!"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can deal with customers at a restaurant.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can say and use words like<span class=\"italic\"> scent</span> and <span class=\"italic\">scene</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use proper intonation and stress in long questions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What special event have you been to at a restaurant or in a banquet hall?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How were the tables arranged?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What were the decorations like?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{